///! runtime/panic: the panic funnel `__cryo_panic` and everything a program
///! names around it.  Both strategies define the same symbols; a build
///! defines the one it is compiled with (`panic_unwind`), so a program's
///! runtime archive holds exactly one of them.

namespace CryoRt::Panic;

/// The abort strategy: report, then end the process.
module abort;

/// The unwinding strategy: raise through the `_Unwind_*` ABI.
module unwind;
